# CODEOWNERS — requests review from the repository owner on changed paths.
# Syntax: pattern  @owner (one per line). This makes @1arley an automatic
# required reviewer for all changes, enabling branch protection rule
# "Require review from Code Owners".

# Default owner for everything in the repository.
* @1arley

# CI/CD pipeline changes should get an explicit review (overlapping with the
# default above keeps them enforced even if the wildcard is edited later).
/.github/                 @1arley
/Dockerfile               @1arley
/docker-compose.yml       @1arley
/prisma/schema.prisma     @1arley
